# Approach 1: Sliding Window

# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(n*k^2)$$

- Space complexity: $$O(1)$$

# Code
```Java []
class Solution {
    public int largestInteger(int[] nums, int k) {
        int n = nums.length;
        int res = -1;

        for(int num : nums) {
            int cnt = 0;
            for(int i=0;i<=n-k;i++) {
                for(int j=i;j<i+k;j++) {
                    if(nums[j]==num) {
                        cnt++;
                        break;
                    }
                }
            }

            if(cnt == 1) {
                res = Math.max(res, num);
            }
        }

        return res;
    }
}
```
